				{
					"id": 751490911,
					"content": "看上去還滿完整的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490912
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751490912,
					"content": "真是的，什麼叫「看上去還滿完整」啦！唉…沒有受傷就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751490915,
					"content": "唔，沒想到火山口下面真的有這麼大的空間，不過周圍怎麼黑漆漆的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490916,
						751490918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751490916,
					"content": "發點光，派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490917
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751490917,
					"content": "好哦，我努力發點…要是能發出來才奇怪！在這種什麼都沒有的地方，能發的只有火！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751490920,
					"content": "還是先稍微探索下周圍吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751490921,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751490918,
					"content": "火把，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490919
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751490919,
					"content": "#就算{F#妳}{M#你}用這樣理所當然的語氣，沒有的東西還是拿不出來的啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751490913,
					"content": "稍微嚇出來了一點…我是說靈魂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490914
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751490914,
					"content": "好欸！還有開玩笑的精神，看來很健康！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751490915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
