					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491102,
					"content": "怎麼了？看上去不是很舒服的樣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491103,
					"content": "呃呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491104,
					"content": "那個難道是…深淵？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491105,
					"content": "「正是如此…深淵的魔物正如頑疾一般侵入聖城圖蘭。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491106,
					"content": "「到了這種程度，說不定已經無法將之一點點驅逐，得將整座圖蘭聖山一同毀掉才能遏制它們的步伐呢…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491107,
					"content": "當你發現一隻深淵魔物的時候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751491108,
					"content": "「說不定家裡已經全都是這些漆黑又黏答答的敵人了…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491109,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491110,
					"content": "唔，你們在說什麼恐怖的話呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491111,
					"content": "砍掉腿就能遏制它們的步伐了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751491112,
					"content": "真是讓人豁然開朗，剩下的工作就是找到它們的腿在哪了…你以為我會這樣說嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491113,
					"content": "唔嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491114,
					"content": "「哈哈，真可惜，小傢伙，也許大部分的深淵魔物都不靠腿移動呢。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491115,
					"content": "「…只有將這攔路的陰影之敵清除掉，你們才能通過此處，前往聖山之心。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491116,
					"content": "「儘管已無法令這破碎的城市恢復原樣，但至少也不應讓它的殘軀被漆黑的魔物佔有。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491117,
					"content": "等等，不是有大火球嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751491118,
					"content": "是啊，大火球不就是用來對抗深淵的東西嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491119,
					"content": "「大火球…你是說『象擬聚星』嗎？牠只有在初步接觸深淵時與對方一同湮滅才能起到作用，否則反而會被深淵蝕化包裹…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491120,
					"content": "「只可惜，這座城市被封絕太久…而為了維持穩定，『象擬聚星』不能被隨意移動…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491121,
					"content": "「受龍所選者啊…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491122,
					"content": "呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491123,
					"content": "「聖山之心是圖蘭建立以後，才重新開掘的區域…由最初的一尊秘源龍像看守。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491124,
					"content": "「想要進入聖山之心，就必須獲得許可…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龍僕"
				},
				{
					"id": 751491125,
					"content": "「只不過，那隻秘源龍像的能源亦受到侵蝕，也得想辦法讓它重新啟動起來…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751491126
